 "name_en": "Convergent Invoicing – Invoice Creation for Usage and Service (2BG)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Convergent Invoicing – Invoice Creation for Usage and Service (2BG)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio9cf84da6546e48188970a8c91f714023\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio9cf84da6546e48188970a8c91f714023__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item enables the creation of a consolidated customer invoice from multiple input channels in a high-volume scenario. Billable data received from external channels is persisted in the format of billable items.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item enables the creation of billing and invoicing documents as follows:</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Using billable items received from external systems</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Using billable items created from rating</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Using billable items created from billing plan</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Using billable items created from invoice corrections</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Using billable items imported from spreadsheets</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio9cf84da6546e48188970a8c91f714023__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create billable items</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute billing</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute invoicing</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio9cf84da6546e48188970a8c91f714023__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Use high-volume invoicing for service and subscription business models</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Integrate customer financial management automatically</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>集中开发票 – 为用途和服务创建发票 (2BG)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio9cf84da6546e48188970a8c91f714023\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio9cf84da6546e48188970a8c91f714023__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">在大批量场景中，此范围项目支持从多个输入渠道创建合并客户发票。从外部渠道接收的可开票数据以可开票项目的格式保留。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目支持按如下方式创建开票和开发票凭证：</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">使用从外部系统接收的可开票项目</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">使用根据定价创建的可开票项目</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">使用根据开票计划创建的可开票项目</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">使用根据发票更正创建的可开票项目</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">使用从电子表格导入的可开票项目</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio9cf84da6546e48188970a8c91f714023__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建可开票项目</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行开票</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行开发票</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio9cf84da6546e48188970a8c91f714023__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">针对服务和订阅业务模式使用大量开票</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">自动集成客户财务管理</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
